## Summary  
In this lab you:  
- Deployed a VM from a template for monitoring scenarios.  
- Created an alert rule for VM deletion.  
- Configured an action group to notify via email.  
- Triggered the alert by deleting a VM and verified the notification.  
- Set up an alert processing rule to suppress notifications during maintenance.  
- Used Azure Monitor Logs to query metrics and visualize data. :contentReference[oaicite:28]{index=28}  

